./data/102/qa/audit.log:29:1. **No `must` point anywhere in the depth of aisles 1–16** — the store's largest wing (x 476–900, y 139–314, ~150 product labels). The only nearby point, (700,125), is the north cross aisle at the aisle *mouths* — the exact store-24 signature. Evidence: crops `r0c1`/`r0c2`, aisle march. Truth: those corridors are green their full length. Fix (walk_truth): `(700,250)` aisle 9 mid-depth, `(860,230)` aisle 15 mid-depth.
./data/102/qa/audit.log:31:3. **No `must_not` for the South Flo Pizza service island interior** (x 434–548, y 482–579, 154 m² — the largest staff island on the open sales floor). It is sealed only because the extractor captured its closed outline as a fixture poly; nothing in this store's truth pinned it, unlike 659's "Deli island interior (staff)". Evidence: zoom `z_pizza`, suspect-floor detector hit before fixture subtraction. Fix: `must_not (490,530)`.
