- **Mechanical:** `verify: []`, both coverage lists empty, 1 component, walkable 32.1 % → 32.3 %.
- **Visual sweep:** all 9 crops compared against page 2. Every aisle 1–31 corridor is green full length (row scans confirm: west wing to x=110, or x=168 where aisles 4–9 stop at the Pharmacy room; east wing to x≈992 at the Water/Sodas run). Back-wall service aisle green x 110–994 continuous. All 13 culled pockets classified: 4 enclosed rooms (restroom vestibule + both restrooms + the room east of Lease Space), 8 checkout-lane interiors, 1 cart-corral interior — every one already carries a `must_not`. Pharmacy is a sealed drawn block with green frontage on its east and south faces (the store-24 failure mode is **not** present here).
