## One thing to know about your shell
`./rebuild.sh 25` exited 1 on my first runs with 2 failures (`test_heb.py::test_heb_client_launches_normal_chrome...`, `test_onboarding_placement.py::test_pipeline_requires_live_verification...`). These are **not** store data: they reproduce with `data/25/` moved out of the tree entirely, and they are caused by two env vars set in this session — `HEB_RUNTIME_DIR=runtime/onboarding-25` (so the chrome profile path is `runtime/onboarding-25/chrome`, not `runtime/chrome`) and `PIPE_NO_BROWSER=1` (pipeline defers placement and returns 0). With both unset:

